    qa:inDomain <https://wod.wiki/qa/domain/notebooks> ;
    rdfs:comment "Every user-owned `Note` remains anchored in private `notebook/journal` while supporting many-to-many `NotebookLink` membership across multiple user `Notebook`s via `PublicationPill` and `NotePromotionSheet` (desktop popover and 375×812 mobile bottom sheet), alongside mobile `PropertyOverrideSheet` targeting (`notebook/custom`). Conversely, read-only Feed `Note`s render an explicit `From <Feed> · Read-only` badge (never `\"Private\"`), offer `Fork to My Notes` in `NotePromotionSheet` to create an editable user copy with live `Note Provenance` linking back to the upstream `Note`, and index-first peer Feeds support zero-import remote Notebook preview with on-demand viewing and `Clone to My Notes` target notebook selection." ;
    qa:hasStep <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/NBK-02/beat/Seed>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/NBK-02/beat/Enter>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/NBK-02/beat/Sense>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/NBK-02/beat/Drive>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/NBK-02/beat/Prove> .

